[statement]
Reduced from postmarketOS v26.06 over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and
`community`, 2026-11-11), asked for `device-asus-me176c`; postmarketOS's
repository first. `postmarketos-base` needs `postmarketos-ramdisk`, which
`postmarketos-initramfs` provides and which needs `udev`, and then
`postmarketos-base-init`, which `postmarketos-base-openrc` provides and
which needs `busybox-mdev-openrc`, which needs `openrc`. apk installs the
second chain's packages before the first's: placing `udev-init-scripts`
reaches `udev-init-scripts-openrc`, which the walk has not reached and
which provides `dev-openrc`, and so `busybox-mdev-openrc`, which provides
it too and which its condition does not name, with `openrc` under it
(`install-order/a-package-whose-condition-may-hold-leads-to-a-provider-it-does-not-name`).

[repository]
P:postmarketos-initramfs
V:3.11.0-r1
D:udev
p:postmarketos-ramdisk=3.11.0-r1

P:postmarketos-base-openrc
V:62-r0
k:10
D:busybox-mdev-openrc udev-init-scripts-openrc
p:postmarketos-base-init

P:device-asus-me176c
V:8-r1
D:postmarketos-base

P:postmarketos-base
V:62-r0
D:postmarketos-ramdisk postmarketos-base-init

[repository]
P:bridge
V:1.5-r5

P:busybox-mdev-openrc
V:1.37.0-r31
D:openrc>=0.24.1-r6
p:dev-openrc

P:eudev
V:3.2.14-r6
D:udev-init-scripts so:libblkid.so.1
p:udev=176

P:ifupdown-ng
V:0.13.0-r0
k:900
D:bridge
p:ifupdown-any

P:libblkid
V:2.42.3-r1
D:so:libeconf.so.0
p:so:libblkid.so.1=1.1.0

P:libeconf
V:0.8.3-r0
p:so:libeconf.so.0=0.8.3

P:openrc
V:0.63.2-r0
D:ifupdown-any

P:udev-init-scripts
V:35-r1

P:udev-init-scripts-openrc
V:35-r1
p:dev-openrc
i:openrc udev-init-scripts=35-r1

[request]
device-asus-me176c

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install udev-init-scripts 35-r1
install bridge 1.5-r5
install ifupdown-ng 0.13.0-r0
install openrc 0.63.2-r0
install udev-init-scripts-openrc 35-r1
install busybox-mdev-openrc 1.37.0-r31
install libeconf 0.8.3-r0
install libblkid 2.42.3-r1
install eudev 3.2.14-r6
install postmarketos-initramfs 3.11.0-r1
install postmarketos-base-openrc 62-r0
install postmarketos-base 62-r0
install device-asus-me176c 8-r1
